  "bodyHash": "4e2aeb153d01c0b0",
  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1492/807/javaw_gwd4nirndd-ezgif.gif\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">此模组为您的世界添加了可驯服的狮子动物。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">您可以在稀树草原生物群系中找到它们。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">(在Forge中，您可以通过编辑data -&gt; biome tags和biome modifier文件夹中的json文件或通过资源包来更改此和其他生成设置</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">或者在Fabric中有一个相应的配置文件)</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">您可以使用任何食物物品来驯服它们。(每次尝试有10%的概率)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">如果未被驯服，它会偶尔攻击周围的生物，除非它是母狮。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">当它们咆哮时，除狮子外的所有附近的生物都会试图逃跑。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">它们还会吃地上的肉类和鱼类物品，这样会恢复它们的生命值。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">休息和攻击也会略微恢复其生命值。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">只有公母狮子可以交配，小狮子没有鬃毛。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">幼崽会跟随成年狮子，而母狮会跟随雄狮。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">雄狮有15种身体颜色变体，而雌狮只有5种，因为它们没有鬃毛，</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">并且它们也有眼睛颜色的变体。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">它们有三种行为类型(<strong>aquarius libs 1.0.1+</strong>会在主人更改其行为时显示消息)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">-游荡(四处游荡；如果被驯化，则会在您将其放入游荡模式的方块周围游荡)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">-休息(停留在原地)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"-跟随(跟随主人)</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>Forge&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;26.x | 1.21.x | 1.20.4 | 1.20.1 | 1.18.2</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>NeoForge 26.x | 1.21.x</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>Fabric&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 26.x | 1.21.x | 1.20.4 | 1.20.1</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f90;font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>如果您需要CurseForge上不同版本的模组，请给我发送私信</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f90;font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><a style=\"color:#f90\" href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/aquarius_playz/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/aquarius_playz/projects</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#36f;font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>在X (twitter)上关注我</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#36f;font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://x.com/Aquarius_playz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://x.com/Aquarius_playz</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aquarius-libs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1577/494/639022024300181764.png\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><a style=\"color:#f00;font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aquarius-libs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>此模组需要安装AQUARIUSLIBS</strong></a></span></p>",
